# wandr app registry — curated apps to publish.
#
# One app per line:   <app-dir under apps/user/>  |  <short description>
# The description is optional (used for `wandr list`); the display name comes
# from package.toml `label`, id/version from `app_id`/`version`.
#
# build-registry.sh packs each app whose components/*.wasm exists on disk and
# skips (with a warning) any that isn't built yet — so uncomment/build as needed.

wandr.video.player   | HW-decoded video playback (wandr:video)
wandr.audio.player   | Gapless audio player
wandr.tetris         | Tetris — tiny native demo
wandr.slint.test     | Slint UI framework demo
wandr.avalonia.demo  | Avalonia (.NET) UI demo
wandr.swiftui.demo   | SwiftUI / OpenSwiftUI demo
wandr.jellyfin       | Jellyfin media client
wandr.navidrome      | Navidrome music client

# Needs a build before it can be published (no components/*.wasm on disk):
# wandr.dioxus.demo  | Dioxus UI demo
